{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33109","headline":"题云阳高少府衙斋 · 储嗣宗","name":"题云阳高少府衙斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大隐能兼济，轩窗逐胜开。\n远含云水思，深得栋梁材。\n吏散山逾静，庭闲鸟自来。\n更怜幽砌色，秋雨长莓苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储嗣宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}